          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">When an Enemy model in BtB with a Friendly Kumo model would move or place, it may not move or be placed except to change facing this turn.
If activated, the model must declare an action permitted while in BtB.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry name="Webbed Ground" id="f921-a2e4-d60a-8402" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="model">
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink name="Faction Terrain Cards" id="846a-cbfc-3959-1c83" hidden="false" primary="true" targetId="bbd2-e0c8-797a-3f03"/>
      </categoryLinks>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="2f51-527b-6773-94cc" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="5"/>
      </constraints>
      <costs>
        <cost name=" Rice" typeId="a111-8656-5c05-7415" value="0"/>
      </costs>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Webbed Ground" id="ee11-dd85-bbe8-ce15" hidden="false" typeId="6fa2-988d-fc04-c751" typeName="Special Card (Terrain)">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Base" typeId="c40b-3106-986d-4db5">Card</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Passage" typeId="3df8-6a47-0c4d-73e7">Normal</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Visibility" typeId="9858-c2c1-b6fc-b75c">Clear</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Size" typeId="000a-cf92-4d1e-c934">Zero</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="eaef-482b-c5d3-866e">Destructible</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9cfa-9bd0-0b1b-9c06">When a model that is not Kumo contacts one or more Webbed Ground terrain during a Walk, Melee, Run or Charge, it loses 1&quot; of movement (to a minimum of 1 &quot; movement).
Enemy models in Webbed Ground Terrain lose Cloudwalk and Camouflage.
While in the Webbed Ground, Friendly Faction models gain Sidestep Attack (0) and Sidestep Defence (0).
When an Enemy model is within one ore more Webbed Ground Terrain uses a Ki Feat or Ki Boost, the cost in Ki Tokens is increased by 1, and you may choose one Kumo model to gain 1 Ki Token.
You may only have a maximum of five Webbed Ground in play at any time.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry name="Boundary Posts" id="6c6c-d7a5-e113-bd08" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="model">
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink name="Faction Terrain Cards" id="4a22-e071-0705-9c83" hidden="false" primary="true" targetId="bbd2-e0c8-797a-3f03"/>
      </categoryLinks>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="4582-8b62-a616-a1ad" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
      </constraints>
      <costs>
        <cost name=" Rice" typeId="a111-8656-5c05-7415" value="4"/>
      </costs>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Boundary Posts" id="2e65-6ddc-42c7-fcf7" hidden="false" typeId="6fa2-988d-fc04-c751" typeName="Special Card (Terrain)">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Base" typeId="c40b-3106-986d-4db5">30mm</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Passage" typeId="3df8-6a47-0c4d-73e7">Normal</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Visibility" typeId="9858-c2c1-b6fc-b75c">Clear</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Size" typeId="000a-cf92-4d1e-c934">Small</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="eaef-482b-c5d3-866e">Destructible</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9cfa-9bd0-0b1b-9c06">During your Warband Terrain deployment, give one of these Terrain elements to your Opponent to Deploy first, then Deploy the other Terrain element as usual.
This Terrain element must be Deployed within 2&quot; of the Centreline. It may be Placed within 3&quot; of restricted Terrain or Objectives.
While within 2&quot; of this Terrain element, Enemy models gain Cowardly.
The first time in any Activation that an Enemy model passes through any line between these two posts, it must take a Fear (5) Test or their activation ends in contact with the line between them.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry name="Egg Sacks" id="8f7d-e3a5-5296-27f4" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="model">
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink name="Faction Terrain Cards" id="a2be-3b78-25b3-5c58" hidden="false" primary="true" targetId="bbd2-e0c8-797a-3f03"/>
      </categoryLinks>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="462a-a29f-4fea-76c8" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="2"/>
      </constraints>
      <costs>
        <cost name=" Rice" typeId="a111-8656-5c05-7415" value="2"/>
      </costs>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Egg Sacks" id="8ecd-4c24-fefc-496b" hidden="false" typeId="6fa2-988d-fc04-c751" typeName="Special Card (Terrain)">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Base" typeId="c40b-3106-986d-4db5">40mm</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Passage" typeId="3df8-6a47-0c4d-73e7">Normal</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Visibility" typeId="9858-c2c1-b6fc-b75c">Clear</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Size" typeId="000a-cf92-4d1e-c934">Medium</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="eaef-482b-c5d3-866e">Destructible</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9cfa-9bd0-0b1b-9c06">When an Enemy model comes into contact with this Terrain element, The Egg Sacs Terrain element is Destroyed and removed from the board, without the need for spending two Ki or making a Wait Action.
When this Terrain element is Destroyed, summon and Deploy an Endless Procession of Arachnid Presence, by replacing this Terrain element (Even if this results in the model being Deployed in a ZOC or BtB with an Enemy model), with one unmarked Wound Box.
You cannot have more of these models in play than Wound Tracks on the card.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry name="Trap Door Web" id="fe1e-ec1b-f5fd-8a56" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="model">
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink name="Faction Terrain Cards" id="6b22-3fe4-2524-5d5b" hidden="false" primary="true" targetId="bbd2-e0c8-797a-3f03"/>
      </categoryLinks>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="7a69-7b55-9c4e-a9bb" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
      </constraints>
      <costs>
        <cost name=" Rice" typeId="a111-8656-5c05-7415" value="2"/>
      </costs>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Trap Door Web" id="ddb3-59b4-c9b6-39c7" hidden="false" typeId="6fa2-988d-fc04-c751" typeName="Special Card (Terrain)">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Base" typeId="c40b-3106-986d-4db5">50mm</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Passage" typeId="3df8-6a47-0c4d-73e7">Normal</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Visibility" typeId="9858-c2c1-b6fc-b75c">Clear</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Size" typeId="000a-cf92-4d1e-c934">Zero</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="eaef-482b-c5d3-866e">Destructible</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9cfa-9bd0-0b1b-9c06">Up to two Friendly Kumo models gain Flank.
Instead of declaring a neutral table edge when using a model with Flank, you may note this Terrain element to be the model&apos;s entry point and Deploy it in contact with this Terrain element.
THIS IS HIDDEN INFORMATION
This Terrain element must be Deployed within your half of the table and not in a Scenario Zone.
In the End Phase, you may choose a Friendly Kumo model that is Elsewhere.
That Kumo engages an Enemy model within 6&quot; of this Terrain element in a Melee Exchange. Ignore requirements to be in BtB.
That Kumo model has the Initiative. Do not Move the models or Turn them to face each other. Neither model is Surprised.
Models may not use Special Abilities for the duration of this Exchange.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
