            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9cfa-9bd0-0b1b-9c06">Friendly Kumo models in BtB with this Terrain element gain one Ki in the Starting Phase.
If this Terrain element is Destroyed by an Enemy model, the Opponent Gains 1 Scenario Point.</characteristic>
