            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">During an Enemy model&apos;s activation in which it enters BtB with a Friendly Kimura model, that Enemy model makes an Opposed Size Challenge Test with the Kimura, if the Enemy model fails, it gains a Blind Marker.
This is a Trap effect.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
