            <profile name="Unique Effects" id="dd0a-31c1-6333-aad0" hidden="false" typeId="2f00-4eb0-a8cb-7022" typeName="Unique Effects">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">This model may perform a Wait Action to increase its Move Statistic to 6 until the End Phase.
If this model begins its activation within a Webbed Ground terrain feature then it does not lose an Activation Counter the first time each turn it performs this Wait Action.


When this model suffers Wounds in a Melee Exchange, the attacker suffers one Wound ignoring Tough.


This model does not lose Movement for Contacting Webbed Ground.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
