      <profiles>
        <profile name="The Family" id="e8de-7b21-7d98-0445" hidden="false" typeId="d2bb-86b4-edf3-c4e5" typeName="Special Card">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">- When a Friendly model loses its last Control Marker, before it returns to the opposing Warband, distribute a number of Ki Tokens to Friendly Kimura models equal to that model&apos;s Ki Statistic.
- Once per game Friendly Kimura with Camouflage gain Camouflage (-4&quot;) until the End Phase.
- Darkness: During the first turn, non-Sixth Sense, non-Bakemono, non-Soulless models may only draw LoS up to 4&quot;.
- During the first turn, Friendly Kimura ignore Darkness and Breath of Yurei effects.

This Warband must include at least as many Kimura models as non-Kimura models (not yet enforced in BS).

Permitted [Kumo, Cultist, Ronin Yokai, Ronin Tenbatsu]</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
